  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.62,
   "text": "You're paying every month for things you forgot you have. There's a five-minute check that finds"
  },
  {
   "s": 4.62,
   "e": 9.22,
   "text": "them, but most people make one mistake at the end and keep paying. Here's what it looks like,"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.44,
   "e": 16.36,
   "text": "a streaming app 5099, a second one 1199, music 1099, cloud storage 299, and a gym you last went"
  },
  {
   "s": 16.36,
   "e": 23.16,
   "text": "to in August $40. That's $82 a month, almost $1000 a year. Step one, open your bank app,"
  },
  {
   "s": 23.3,
   "e": 28.18,
   "text": "search last month for every amount that repeats, and write each one down. Step two, next to each"
  },
  {
   "s": 28.18,
   "e": 32.92,
   "text": "one, ask a single question. Did I use this in the last 30 days? Not might I use it, did I?"
  },
  {
   "s": 33.36,
   "e": 37.5,
   "text": "Step three, cancel every no, the gym from August gone, the second streaming app gone,"
  },
  {
   "s": 37.7,
   "e": 42.38,
   "text": "cloud storage you use every day, keep it. You can always rejoin the month you actually need it."
  },
  {
   "s": 42.62,
   "e": 47.46,
   "text": "So what's the mistake? People pause instead of canceling or they tell themselves they'll do it"
  },
  {
   "s": 47.46,
   "e": 53.72,
   "text": "on the first, then the first comes and it bills again. Do it today and $82 a month becomes 30."
  },
  {
   "s": 53.72,
   "e": 59.08,
   "text": "That's over $600 a year back from five minutes. Here's the checklist every repeat,"
  },
  {
   "s": 59.36,
   "e": 63.74,
   "text": "used in 30 days, cancel every no today, send this to the friend with four streaming apps."
  },
  {
   "s": 64.16,
   "e": 69.08,
   "text": "That's what demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it"
  },
  {
   "s": 69.08,
   "e": 73.9,
   "text": "down into small steps you can actually do. And follow because tonight's reel is how Rohan got"
  },
  {
   "s": 73.9,
   "e": 79.3,
   "text": "his old friends back with one calendar invite. If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the"
  },
  {
   "s": 79.3,
   "e": 79.64,
   "text": "bio."
  }
